# A measured Seed widens Fold: the accumulator is a tuple, which no literal
# seed could spell.
Cursed Energy: stdin
Cursed Technique: Split Text by "\n"
Channeled Energy: Convert List to Integers
Maximum Technique: Fold
    Seed: (xs) -> tuple(0, 0)
    Using: (acc, x) -> tuple(prow(acc) + x, pcol(acc) + 1)
Cursed Technique: Apply
    Using: (t) -> prow(t) / pcol(t)
Reveal: stdout
